``` KV-01 | KV Store Status Across Every Member
    Interpretation and RCA: Splunk Administrator Field Manual (Gaurav Malik),
    entry KV-01. https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0HRXCT384

    Run on: SH-local (or splunk_server=* across the SHC) for current state, SH
    for the history.
    Query: Status changes over the last week (SH)
    If this returns nothing, run probes/KV-01-probe.spl,
    probes/KV-01-probe-rest.spl to confirm the data it reads exists here.
```
index=_internal sourcetype=splunkd earliest=-7d
    (component=KVStore* OR component=KVStorage*)
    ("status" OR "failed" OR "Failed")
| rex field=_raw "\]\s+-\s+(?<msg>.+)$"
| eval msg_sig=replace(msg, "\d+", "N")
| stats count earliest(_time) as first_seen latest(_time) as last_seen
        by host component log_level msg_sig
| convert ctime(first_seen) ctime(last_seen)
| sort - last_seen
